nD1.text:
API fields
• POST /custody/scan {payload | shortCode, siteId, deviceId, clientRecordedAt, clientSeq} → CustodyScanResult {result, booking (bookingNo, status, dropDeadlineAt), package (seqNo, total), trf (itemName, batchNo, lines[]), expectedPackageCount, scannedPackages}
• Wrong site → CustodyIntendedSite {name, addressLine, city}
• Offline queue → POST /custody/scan-batch
• Submit: POST /bookings/{id}/receipts → ReceiptSubmit {actualPackageCount, condition, itemMatches, batchMatches, quantitySufficient, sealIntact, observedBatchNo, discrepancyFlag, discrepancyNotes, packages[], photoFileIds}

nF2.text:
API fields
• GET /bookings/{id}/report → CustomerReportView {reportNo, ulrNo, versions[] (versionNo, status, isAmendment, issueDate, releasedAt, verificationCode, shareLinks[])}
• Download: /report-versions/{id}/download-url
• Share: POST …/share-links {expiresInDays, recipientNote} → token shown once; revoke: …/share-links/{linkId}
• Rate: POST /bookings/{id}/rating
• Dispute: POST /bookings/{id}/disputes {typeCode, description} → Dispute {disputeNo, status, labResponseDueAt, messages[], evidence[], outcome, refundAmount}; window ← disputeWindowEndsAt

nF3.text:
API fields
• GET /bookings/{id}/payments → PaymentOrder {attemptNo, status, amount, createdAt}
• GET /bookings/{id}/financial-documents → FinancialDocument {docType, docNo, issuer, taxable, cgst, sgst, igst, total, issuedAt, fileAvailable}
• Download: /financial-documents/{id}/download

nF6.text:
API fields
• Start testing: POST /bookings/{id}/start-testing {expectedReportDate} (T-18)
• ETA change: …/expected-report-date {expectedReportDate, reason}
• Upload: …/report-versions/upload-url → ReportVersionCreate {fileId, reportNo, ulrNo, issueDate, bindPackagePayload, parameterResults[], amendmentReason}
• Submit: /report-versions/{id}/submit (T-19). Needs a CLEAN file scan, parameters ⊆ booked lines and a unique ULR.

nF9.text:
API fields
• /admin/disputes → AdminDispute; decide: AdminDisputeDecisionRequest {outcome, rationale, refundAmount}
• Refunds: AdminRefund {amount, policyRule, status, approvedByUserId}
• Payouts: AdminPayout {labOrgId, bankAccountNumberLast4, amount, status, eligibleAt}; release with step-up MFA + AdminPayoutRelease {externalRef (UTR)}
• Holds: AdminPayoutHold
